<!--
purpose: Canonical skeleton for the `ai-assisted-dev` workflow record — tool-to-task map, security-critical block-list, context files, secrets exclusion, retention checks, prompt template, label, and the cadence comparison.
consumes: The tools in use, the repo layout, each vendor's data-usage terms, and the PR quality dashboard split by the ai-assisted label.
produces: A committed record at .product/ai-assisted-dev/<team>.md, mirrored as JSON for scripts/validate-ai-assisted-dev.py.
depends-on: templates/header.yaml, templates/prompt-code.txt, templates/gen-tests.sh, content/02-output-contract.xml, scripts/validate-ai-assisted-dev.py.
token-budget-impact: ~900 tokens to fill end-to-end.
-->
---
version: {{ record_version }}
team: {{ team_name }}
owner: {{ owner }}
---

# Team

- name: {{ team_name }}
- repo_url: {{ repo_url }}
- record_version: {{ record_version }} (bump whenever the map is tightened)
- owner: {{ owner }}

# Tool-to-task map

One line per task class; tool is claude-code | cursor | copilot | other | ai-off; checkpoint is self-review | one-reviewer | two-reviewers-non-prompter | ai-off. Data migrations and infrastructure sit at two reviewers or ai-off.

- boilerplate-scaffolding: {{ scaffolding_tool }} / <checkpoint>
- unit-tests: {{ tests_tool }} / <checkpoint>
- refactor: <tool> / <checkpoint>
- code-review: <tool> / <checkpoint>
- documentation: <tool> / <checkpoint>
- data-migration: <tool> / <two-reviewers-non-prompter | ai-off>
- infrastructure: <tool> / <two-reviewers-non-prompter | ai-off>

# Block-list

All eight areas; policy is ai-off or two-reviewers-non-prompter; a labelled PR touching a listed path with fewer than two reviewers does not merge.

- authentication-session: paths <globs> policy <policy>
- authorization: paths <globs> policy <policy>
- cryptography-keys: paths <globs> policy <policy>
- payments-billing: paths <globs> policy <policy>
- pii-processing: paths <globs> policy <policy>
- secrets-config-loading: paths <globs> policy <policy>
- production-iac: paths <globs> policy <policy>
- database-migrations: paths <globs> policy <policy>

# Context files

One per tool in the map.

- {{ primary_tool }}: {{ context_file_path }} last_reviewed {{ context_reviewed_on }}
- <tool>: <CLAUDE.md | .cursor/rules | .github/copilot-instructions.md> last_reviewed <YYYY-MM-DD>

# Exclusion file

- path: {{ exclusion_file }}
- excludes: <.env*, secrets/**, data exports, customer fixtures>

# Tool retention

- {{ primary_tool }}: terms_checked <true | false>, source {{ retention_source_url }}, checked_on <YYYY-MM-DD>
- <tool>: terms_checked <true | false>, source <URL>, checked_on <YYYY-MM-DD>

# Prompt template

- path: templates/prompt-code.txt
- blocks: Context, Task, Requirements, Output

# AI-assisted label

- label: {{ ai_label }}
- auto_merge_disabled: true

# Decision

{{ decision_statement }}

# Evidence

- {{ context_file_url }}
- <exclusion file URL>
- <cadence comparison dashboard URL>

# Review

- cadence: {{ review_cadence }}
- next_review_at: {{ next_review_date }}
- last_outcome: period <YYYY-MM>, ai_assisted pr_count <n> defect_escape_rate <0-1> revert_rate <0-1> churn_2w_rate <0-1>, other pr_count <n> defect_escape_rate <0-1> revert_rate <0-1> churn_2w_rate <0-1>, worse_on <list>, map_tightened <true when worse_on is non-empty>, action <what changed in the map>, url <dashboard>
